    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Lethalicia Stories&quot; is a command battle-style role-playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The RPG released by Project Candidates is now available on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become the main character Jack, running around the field and being robbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The purpose of the journey is to retrieve the royal family's holy sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/extras/4b4ba69e3f16acd1a154e94496adcab5.avif?t=1754398373\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd33Meeting friends to share your adventure with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can bring up to 3 companions to accompany you on your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd33Adventure stage Set in Lesalisia, which exists on the continent of Faneia. The world is created with a fusion of retro dots and 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with immediate-X input processors only. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following keyboards are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/extras/c4e6b21bb8d372cbafbb1eee4536c9cb.avif?t=1754398373\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2191 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Up\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff37 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Up\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2193 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Down\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff33 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Down\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2190 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Left\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff21 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Left\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2192 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Right\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff24 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Right\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move Key +\u3010Shift\u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Dash\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010space\u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Enter\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Enter\u3011\u00a0Key \u00a0\uff1a \uff08Enter\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 ESC \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 TAB \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 Ctrl \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff2d \u3011Key\u00a0 \u00a0 \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 ESC \u3011\u00a0Key \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 TAB \u3011\u00a0Key \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Lethalicia Stories&quot; is a command battle-style role-playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The RPG released by Project Candidates is now available on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become the main character Jack, running around the field and being robbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The purpose of the journey is to retrieve the royal family's holy sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/extras/4b4ba69e3f16acd1a154e94496adcab5.avif?t=1754398373\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd33Meeting friends to share your adventure with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can bring up to 3 companions to accompany you on your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd33Adventure stage Set in Lesalisia, which exists on the continent of Faneia. The world is created with a fusion of retro dots and 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with immediate-X input processors only. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following keyboards are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/extras/c4e6b21bb8d372cbafbb1eee4536c9cb.avif?t=1754398373\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2191 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Up\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff37 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Up\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2193 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Down\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff33 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Down\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2190 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Left\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff21 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Left\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \u2192 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Right\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff24 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Right\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move Key +\u3010Shift\u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Dash\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010space\u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Enter\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Enter\u3011\u00a0Key \u00a0\uff1a \uff08Enter\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 ESC \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 TAB \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 Ctrl \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 \uff2d \u3011Key\u00a0 \u00a0 \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 ESC \u3011\u00a0Key \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010 TAB \u3011\u00a0Key \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cRezarlisia Stories\u201d is a command battle-style role-playing game! The story is told in a worldview that expresses the retro worldview of the good old days using pixel art and 3D!",
